Maine codebase ki jaanch ki hai aur mujhe `src/cart.js` mein `cartTotal` function mila hai jo shayad checkout page ke total calculation ke liye zimmedaar hai.

**Meri findings:**

1.  **Potential Bug:** `src/cart.js` mein `cartTotal` function `reduce` method ka use karta hai. Agar cart empty ho ya items ka structure unexpected ho, toh yeh calculation mein gadbad kar sakta hai.
2.  **Usage:** Abhi tak mujhe yeh nahi mila ki yeh function checkout page par kahan call ho raha hai. Ho sakta hai ki checkout page par data fetch karte waqt ya state update karte waqt koi race condition ho rahi ho, jisse total galat update ho raha hai.

**Aapke liye sujhaav:**
*   Jab agli baar yeh issue aaye, toh check karein ki kya cart mein koi "discount" ya "tax" apply ho raha hai jo shayad `cartTotal` function mein handle nahi ho raha.
*   Agar aap chahein, toh main `grep` ka use karke yeh dhoond sakta hoon ki `cartTotal` function poore project mein kahan-kahan use ho raha hai, taaki humein pata chale ki checkout page par data kahan se aa raha hai.

Filhal maine koi file nahi badli hai. Kya aap chahte hain ki main aur gehrai se check karoon ki yeh function kahan call ho raha hai?

